noderedrevpinodes-server (1.2.0-1+revpi11+1) bullseye; urgency=medium

  This update brings stability improvements and prevents an internal crash
  of the IO update. Previously, this behavior might have allowed the process
  to continue while making the IOs unresponsive or inaccessible.
  
  The log outputs are now also displayed in journald and in cockpit.

